name=UI Theme: White / Black
id=theme-white-black
author=Aegis
version=0.1.0
type=tweak
status=in-development
description=Switches Aegis UI log/tag accent theme to white or black (monochrome tweak). In development.
applies=ui_theme:white

# Notes (in development)
# - Change applies= to ui_theme:white, ui_theme:black, or ui_theme:default
# - Apply with: aegis mod apply theme-white-black
# - Or use interactive Settings -> UI theme/tweak
# - Current implementation affects logger tag/accent colors; broader UI theming is planned.
